  © OpenStreetMap contributors, Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0,
  https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
- Historical borders from OpenHistoricalMap: CC0 1.0
- Facts from Wikidata: CC0 1.0
- Images are not part of this repository; they are loaded from Wikimedia
